sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Browser)
    participant FE as Frontend (React UI)
    participant GW as Fastify Gateway (4-Phase Defense)
    participant DB as Google Cloud Firestore
    participant VM as Cloud MicroVM (E2B Sandbox)

    %% -----------------------------------------------------------
    %% 1. USER ACTION & FRONTEND PRE-FLIGHT
    %% -----------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(24, 24, 37)
        Note over User,FE: 1. User Action & Local Verification
        User->>FE: Types prompt & clicks "Send"
        FE->>FE: Local pre-flight checks:<br/>1. Prompt not empty<br/>2. Model selected<br/>3. Active sandbox selected<br/>4. In-flight lock (no concurrent prompt)
        alt No Sandbox Selected
            FE->>User: Prompt: "Select or allocate an active microVM sandbox"
        else Pre-flight Passed
            FE->>FE: Optimistic UI render (append user bubble, typing pulse, clear input)
            FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/agent/prompt/stream (1 SINGLE REQUEST)
        end
    end

    %% -----------------------------------------------------------
    %% 2. BACKEND 4-PHASE DEFENSE PIPELINE
    %% -----------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(35, 30, 50)
        Note over GW: 2. Backend 4-Phase Defense Pipeline
        GW->>GW: Phase 1: JWT Auth (verify token, bind req.userId)
        GW->>GW: Phase 2: Rate Limiting Guard (20 req/min sliding window, fast O(1) drop)
        GW->>GW: Phase 3: Schema Validation (strict Ajv check: prompt, model, session, sandbox)
        GW->>GW: Phase 4: Endpoint Security & Resource Legitimacy:<br/>1. Session Ownership (verify sessionId belongs to req.userId - IDOR prevention)<br/>2. Sandbox Ownership (verify sandboxId belongs to req.userId)<br/>3. Provider Auth (verify linked CLI credentials for selected model)
        opt MicroVM Idle / Detached
            GW->>VM: Auto-reconnect / wake microVM (seamless reactivation, no user prompt)
            VM-->>GW: MicroVM active & socket ready
        end
        opt Session or Sandbox Unauthorized
            GW-->>FE: 403 Forbidden { code: 'UNAUTHORIZED_RESOURCE', message: '...' }
            FE->>User: Display security toast & abort
        end
    end

    %% -----------------------------------------------------------
    %% 3. BACKGROUND PERSISTENCE & SSE STREAM OPEN
    %% -----------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(20, 32, 45)
        Note over GW,DB: 3. Session Snapshot & Stream Initialization
        GW->>DB: Atomic Firestore save (persists user prompt for crash resiliency)
        GW-->>FE: HTTP 200 SSE Stream Headers (text/event-stream)
        GW-->>FE: event: start { sessionId, model, sandboxId }
        GW-->>FE: event: step { id: "step_init", text: "Connected to sandbox & initialized agent" }
    end

    %% -----------------------------------------------------------
    %% 4. CLOUD MICROVM INFERENCE & REAL-TIME STREAMING
    %% -----------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(25, 40, 35)
        Note over GW,VM: 4. Sandboxed CLI Execution & Token Streaming
        GW->>VM: Execute CLI with compacted context (codex / agy / claude)
        loop Live Token & Step Streaming
            VM-->>GW: CLI stdout / stderr tokens
            GW-->>FE: event: token { chunk: "..." }
            FE->>User: Renders smooth typewriter text in chat bubble
            VM-->>GW: Tool / bash execution event
            GW-->>FE: event: step { tool, command, output }
            FE->>User: Updates collapsible execution step list
        end
        opt User clicks "Stop" (Explicit Abort)
            User->>FE: Clicks "Stop" button
            FE->>GW: AbortController.abort() / POST /api/v1/agent/stop
            GW->>VM: Send SIGINT / pkill CLI process in microVM (stops burning tokens)
        end
        opt Tab Closed / Disconnect (Resilient Background Completion)
            Note over GW: Client disconnected midway -> backend marks execution as background,<br/>allows CLI to finish, and persists complete response to Firestore.
        end
        VM-->>GW: CLI process exits (exitCode: 0, turns, totalTokens)
    end

    %% -----------------------------------------------------------
    %% 5. SERVER PERSISTENCE & PIGGYBACKED TERMINAL PAYLOAD
    %% -----------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(40, 28, 40)
        Note over GW,DB: 5. Turn Finalization & Piggybacked Delivery
        GW->>DB: Atomic Firestore save (persists complete assistant response & telemetry)
        GW-->>FE: event: done (Consolidated Payload: Message + Quota + Sandbox)
        Note over FE: Zero auxiliary API requests!<br/>- Updates chat state<br/>- Updates quota meters<br/>- Updates sandbox badge
        FE->>User: Finalized response with code artifacts & copy buttons
    end
